nswers, or unusual situations. If you''d rather talk to a team member now, just say the word.', 'About {t}, I can help with quotes, questions, and booking, but I hand off to a person for firm commitments — say the word and I''ll get one on the line.', 'Owner review pending — confirm BluLadder''s internal rule for ''{t}''. This record governs how the AI behaves; do NOT weaken safety rails or commitment boundaries when publishing.', 'Do not override safety rails. When in doubt, hand off to a human.', ARRAY['ai_governance','internal_rules','escalation']::text[]);